<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-GARAGENT H1 PROFIT, SALES UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GARAGENT H1 PROFIT, SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 22.1	vs     17.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    9.8	vs	5.6</p>
<p>    Net sales		 464.9	vs    398.4</p>
<p>     Domestic sales	 313.3	vs    256.8</p>
<p>     Export sales	   151.6	vs    141.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue	     2.8	vs	4.0</p>
<p>    Material expenditures 351.5	vs    314.6</p>
<p>    Personnel expend.	34.3	vs     27.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     33.7	vs     31.6</p>
<p>    Other costs		14.5	vs     16.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures     11.7	vs	1.0</p>
<p>    Net financial income   12.3 loss vs     12.2 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue    11.0	vs     19.6</p>
<p>	Financial expend.    23.3	vs     31.8</p>
<p>NOTE - GarAgent Rt is a garage services and car dealer company. The figures are unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
